# VST GUI Designer lane

When editing `PluginEditor.*`, product `design/*GUI*`, or `DESIGN.md`:

1. Read [docs/VST_GUI_DESIGNER_AGENT.md](../docs/VST_GUI_DESIGNER_AGENT.md) and [docs/VST_GUI_SYSTEM.md](../docs/VST_GUI_SYSTEM.md).
2. Prefer **vst-gui-designer** for spec/authorship; **cursor-vst-plugin-factory** for implementation unless you are explicitly that agent.
3. GUI PRs: check minimum size, preset browser contract, APVTS-only wiring, audit rubric P0/P1.
4. Log reviews in `docs/reports/VST_GUI_AUDIT_<date>.md`.

PM routes `[Plugin][JUCE][GUI]` to `vst-gui-designer` per [AGENT_TEAM_ROSTER.md](../docs/AGENT_TEAM_ROSTER.md).
